0..77 Comment "// The checker refuses a vector at a length that its value does not stand at."
78..80 Comment "//"
81..157 Comment "// A vector\'s type states its length. A length that disagrees is a mismatch,"
158..176 Comment "// not a coercion."
177..179 Comment "//"
180..253 Comment "// The checker refuses a vector at a length that its constructor does not"
254..331 Comment "// state. It refuses a length written as a call that computes another length."
332..405 Comment "// It also refuses a family that states an element where its length goes."
406..408 Comment "//"
409..483 Comment "// - see: `vector-head.gandr` — what a case on a vector cannot leave out"
484..565 Comment "// - see: #3579 — a family\'s argument written as a call converts with its value"
567..604 Comment "// The naturals the lengths count in."
